p4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721590/extras/d18c6cfaaf2eb0125f84232622351604.poster.avif?t=1729791948\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721590/extras/d18c6cfaaf2eb0125f84232622351604.webm?t=1729791948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721590/extras/d18c6cfaaf2eb0125f84232622351604.mp4?t=1729791948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721590/extras/617d22ad3da4f87a179c7c3fb454da43.webp?t=1729791948\" width=600 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721590/extras/6413a6f3f4ad6eac99f20ed60b61cb74.poster.avif?t=1729791948\" width=280 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721590/extras/6413a6f3f4ad6eac99f20ed60b61cb74.webm?t=1729791948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721590/extras/6413a6f3f4ad6eac99f20ed60b61cb74.mp4?t=1729791948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721590/extras/927a7941b3dab7ea392f2be626690057.poster.avif?t=1729791948\" width=280 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721590/extras/927a7941b3dab7ea392f2be626690057.webm?t=1729791948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spells are your key to survival.</strong> Each offers unique advantages, from powerful attacks to defensive tactics. As you progress, stronger spells drop as loot, with elemental magic playing a big role\u2014hit fire enemies with water spells for extra damage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At higher levels, you can visit a spell enchanter NPC to make your spells even more powerful.</strong> The deeper you go, the stronger and more specialized your magic becomes, helping you face tougher enemies.<br><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721590/extras/c80a8c4a025aad4af071fd5d748d4f23.webp?t=1729791948\" width=600 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every playthrough is unique thanks to our dynamic procedural level generation. Each level features a variety of unique room layouts randomly selected for a fresh experience, ensuring players encounter diverse challenges and enemies with every run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721590/extras/2d9965ba73565c914c90d8ceff4c8a18.webp?t=1729791948\" width=600 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Engaging rogue-like gameplay with procedurally generated dungeons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf A wide array of spells, enchanted items, and gear to customize your playstyle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Upgrade yourself and your spells to become the strongest! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf A wide range of player abilities to choose from</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf The game difficulty adapts to your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf A deep and compelling narrative that explores themes of grief, vengeance, and redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Atmospheric pixel art graphics and an immersive soundtrack for each level and boss fight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Evolve and become stronger as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf <strong>Infinite replayability!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf And most importantly a <strong>dog</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721590/extras/1554f3bbcdc44c2ca8a33057b8d0291f.webp?t=1729791948\" width=600 height=30 /></span>Immerse yourself in a <strong>rich narrative exploring themes of loss</strong>, redemption, and the <strong>blurred lines between hero and villain</strong>. Experience unexpected twists and turns that will keep you on the edge of your seat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721590/extras/6cdec3919a7e679e888cb193570f9de5.webp?t=1729791948\" width=600 height=30 /></span>With haunting pixel art and an atmospheric soundtrack, &quot;Project ELIOT&quot; offers an <strong>immersive experience that lingers long after the final battle</strong>. Are you ready to confront the demons within? The darkness awaits... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare to descend into madness.<br></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong>[*] ERROR 401 <br>KRUGS4ZANFZSA3TPOQQHI4TVMUXA=====</p>",
